    "preamble": "Deepak Khanna vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 23 August, 2023 Bench: Pritinker Diwaker, Ashutosh Srivastava High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2023:Ahc:169599-Db Chief Justice's Court Case :- Writ - C No. - 26909 of 2023 Petitioner :- Deepak Khanna Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 3 Others",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Against this, the petitioner has preferred an appeal wherein the notice has been issued. Learned counsel for the petitioner sates that even though the petitioner has preferred statutory appeal along with stay application, neither the stay application has been disposed of nor the appeal has been heard on merit and meanwhile the respondents are pressing the recovery. Learned Standing Counsel raised an objection that in the present matter a case was also registered as Case Crime No. 83 of 2021 under Section 420 of IPC and Section 63 of Copyright Act.",
